{
  "text": " And a similar protest was held at San Jose's City Hall against recent vaccine mandates. The group voiced their concerns about the threat to freedom of individual choice. We hear more from NTD's David Lam. This is one of the many rallies going on today and here in the Bay Area at City Hall in San Jose, people are calling for more transparency behind the vaccines and the vaccine mandates. My sign is make California free. We need freedom. Having no freedom is illegal. Some attendees called for walkouts. If we don't question, we just let the government or the social media or the businesses tell us. Others shared about vaccine side effects. People are taking them because they're believing the government. They're not looking at the data. One attendee said her mother and two other family members have passed away after getting vaccinated. I have clients that have taken the vaccine and especially the Moderna. Their hair is falling out now. And most of all of them have complete anxiety. But my granddaughter who is only seven years old, she herself has voiced to me that she does not want the shot. The biggest agenda that people need to be concerned about is these health passports or vaccine passports. More of these walkout protests are planned for the remainder of the month. David Lam, NTD News, California.",
